return ['messages'=>['"Realizar compras de forma más rápida, segura y sin contacto ahora está al alcance de los tarjetahabientes de Coopealianza. En Evertec nos honra acompañar a la cooperativa en este paso clave hacia la digitalización de los pagos, ofreciendo tecnología que evoluciona al ritmo de las necesidades de sus asociados y del mercado costarricense".<br/>Jimmy Solano Blanco, Commercial Head de Centroamérica para Evertec'=>'“Making purchases faster, safer, and contactless is now within reach for Coopealianza cardholders. At Evertec, we are honored to support the cooperative in this key step toward the digitalization of payments, offering technology that evolves in step with the needs of its members and the Costa Rican market.”<br><br>Jimmy Solano Blanco, Commercial Head for Central America at Evertec','7df04d1f112bab4e879f1f327362cb28'=>'This evolution positions the Cooperative as an organization focused on optimizing the customer experience by reducing friction in both physical and digital payment processes.','7e71ae0c63da39a837d8da0ff90b202e'=>'Committed to offering modern, secure solutions aligned with the latest digital trends, <a href="https://coopealianza.fi.cr/">Coopealianza R.L.</a> continues to strengthen its value proposition for its members nationwide. As part of its digital transformation journey, Coopealianza has enabled the use of Google Pay and Garmin Pay, allowing  cardholders to make contactless payments from compatible Android devices or smartwatches quickly, securely, and conveniently. Both digital wallets operate using tokenization technology, which enhances transaction security by ensuring that real card details are never shared during a payment.','7fe58c439835cf169ba12907f23294ff'=>'For Coopealianza, this implementation represents a strategic opportunity to strengthen competitiveness and integrate payment solutions that are widely used globally. It also promotes the adoption of digital channels while enhancing its value proposition with modern, agile, and secure services.','926dd2638418006f29d358ca2cd4b7b6'=>'“Making purchases faster, safer, and contactless is now within reach for Coopealianza cardholders. At Evertec, we are honored to support the cooperative in this key step toward the digitalization of payments, offering technology that evolves in step with the needs of its members and the Costa Rican market.”<br><br>Jimmy Solano Blanco, Commercial Head for Central America at Evertec','<strong>¡Felicidades Coopealianza por continuar impulsando la transformación digital del país!</strong>'=>'<strong>Congratulations to Coopealianza for continuing to drive the country’s digital transformation!</strong>','Agradecemos a Coopealianza por su confianza y por permitirnos seguir siendo su aliado estratégico en esta ruta de innovación, eficiencia y crecimiento.'=>'We thank Coopealianza for its trust and for allowing us to continue being its strategic partner on this path of innovation, efficiency, and growth.','Comprometida con ofrecer soluciones modernas, seguras y alineadas a las nuevas tendencias digitales, <a href="https://coopealianza.fi.cr/">Coopealianza R.L.</a> continúa fortaleciendo la oferta de valor para sus asociados en todo el país. En este camino de transformación digital, Coopealianza habilitó el uso de Google Pay y Garmin Pay, permitiendo que sus tarjetahabientes realicen pagos sin contacto desde dispositivos Android o relojes inteligentes compatibles de forma rápida, segura y conveniente. Ambas billeteras digitales funcionan mediante tecnología tokenizada, lo que incrementa la protección de las transacciones al no compartir los datos reales de la tarjeta durante un pago.'=>'Committed to offering modern, secure solutions aligned with the latest digital trends, <a href="https://coopealianza.fi.cr/">Coopealianza R.L.</a> continues to strengthen its value proposition for its members nationwide. As part of its digital transformation journey, Coopealianza has enabled the use of Google Pay and Garmin Pay, allowing  cardholders to make contactless payments from compatible Android devices or smartwatches quickly, securely, and conveniently. Both digital wallets operate using tokenization technology, which enhances transaction security by ensuring that real card details are never shared during a payment.','Con más de 10 años de relación comercial, en Evertec nos enorgullece ser el socio tecnológico que trabaja conjuntamente para hacer posible este avance, proporcionando la infraestructura necesaria para habilitar estas soluciones que impulsan la modernización del ecosistema de pagos costarricense.'=>'With more than 10 years of a commercial relationship, at Evertec we are proud to be the technology partner working jointly to make this advancement possible, providing the necessary infrastructure to enable these solutions that drive the modernization of Costa Rica’s payments ecosystem.','La evolución proyecta a la Cooperativa como una entidad que optimiza la experiencia de sus clientes, al reducir fricciones en los procesos de pago tanto físicos como digitales.'=>'This evolution positions the Cooperative as an organization focused on optimizing the customer experience by reducing friction in both physical and digital payment processes.','Para Coopealianza, esta implementación representa una oportunidad estratégica para fortalecer su competitividad e integrar soluciones de pago ampliamente utilizadas a nivel global. Asimismo, impulsa la adopción de canales digitales, al tiempo que mejora su propuesta de valor con servicios modernos, ágiles y seguros.'=>'For Coopealianza, this implementation represents a strategic opportunity to strengthen competitiveness and integrate payment solutions that are widely used globally. It also promotes the adoption of digital channels while enhancing its value proposition with modern, agile, and secure services.','c02657737932a397debc21bff0a9c899'=>'<strong>Congratulations to Coopealianza for continuing to drive the country’s digital transformation!</strong>','d69724d8693f88c48f795c1d7a3e63ad'=>'With more than 10 years of a commercial relationship, at Evertec we are proud to be the technology partner working jointly to make this advancement possible, providing the necessary infrastructure to enable these solutions that drive the modernization of Costa Rica’s payments ecosystem.','f44c9f5d6bbcaa02c26ab2e2583a5414'=>'We thank Coopealianza for its trust and for allowing us to continue being its strategic partner on this path of innovation, efficiency, and growth.']];
